        "raw": "<p>So at my school we do this thing called a 20% time project and what it is is that you get 20% of your time to work on a project. Whatever project you want. And for my 20 time project I&#39;m making a YouTube series called platinum comics in which I talk about my superhero ideas a la the letters page. I just wanted to tell you guys about it since the letters page inspired it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>thanks @christopher and thanks @adam for giving me the idea.</p>",
